&lt;p&gt;About the team&lt;br&gt;The Enterprise Platform team focuses on delivering the infrastructure and operational capabilities that let large, security-conscious customers run GitLab on their own terms. Within that group, the Dedicated team builds and operates GitLab Dedicated, our single-tenant SaaS offering that gives customers full data and source code isolation, private networking, and data residency in the AWS region of their choice — all deployed and maintained by GitLab with zero infrastructure overhead for the customer. We work asynchronously across regions and partner closely with Cell Infrastructure, Security, Compliance, and the Duo Agent Platform teams to extend agentic AI capabilities and multi-cloud support into single-tenant environments without compromising isolation guarantees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
